Comment: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:21.58,EG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,0)\pos(1278,218.247)}{\pos(2008,327.747)}#Encodergasm Presents
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.83,0:01:38.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A half-century has passed since humanity began moving...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.05,0:01:41.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...its burgeoning population into space.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.94,0:01:44.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These gigantic space colonies orbiting the Earth...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.91,0:01:47.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...became a second home to humanity...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.82,0:01:51.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...where people were born and raised...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.67,0:01:53.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and where they died.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.77,0:01:58.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is the year 0079 of the Universal Century.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.69,0:02:02.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The cluster of colonies furthest from Earth, known as Side 3...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.35,0:02:04.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...proclaimed themselves the Principality of Zeon.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.60,0:02:08.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And launched a war of independence against the Earth Federation.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.15,0:02:13.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In roughly one month of fighting, the Principality of Zeon...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.15,0:02:17.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and the Federation Forces caused the deaths of half the total population.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.74,0:02:21.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Humanity was horrified by its own actions.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.68,0:02:27.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The war became a stalemate, and eight months have now passed.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.75,0:03:43.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Slender, you stay here.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.13,0:03:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, Chief.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.16,0:04:17.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The military facilities appear to be in the upper right block, sir.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.99,0:04:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This should be rush hour, but I only see one car.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.50,0:04:23.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not a person in sight.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.17,0:04:27.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! There's a child!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.08,0:04:29.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.30,0:04:33.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.64,0:04:35.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? He hasn't even eaten yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.96,0:04:37.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.15,0:04:45.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd find you cooped up in here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.69,0:04:51.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got to eat your breakfast... You should take better care of your health!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.15,0:04:53.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello, Amuro. Hello, Amuro.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.81,0:04:55.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're full of energy as always, Haro.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.85,0:04:57.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Amuro.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.91,0:05:00.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were you planning on wearing today?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.61,0:05:01.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.73,0:05:04.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll eat after I finish rewiring this computer.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.33,0:05:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear the evacuation order?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.66,0:05:08.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Evacuation order?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.41,0:05:10.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that what the siren was?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.99,0:05:14.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you listen to the military broadcast?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.16,0:05:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A warship's docking so we have to evacuate.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.80,0:05:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.04,0:05:19.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.69,0:05:21.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, we don't have time!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.93,0:05:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.76,0:05:24.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Evacuate at once!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.51,0:05:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll wait outside. Come on, Haro.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.69,0:05:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right already...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.78,0:05:33.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.10,0:05:35.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, Fraw Bow!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.37,0:05:40.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! You're Amuro's closest neighbor! It was your responsibility to tell him.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.49,0:05:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, about the evacuation?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.36,0:05:44.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course. He's all alone, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.50,0:05:49.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, if military engineers like his dad hadn't moved here in the first place, we...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.32,0:05:53.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you still bitter about them moving us to make way for their research facility?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.91,0:05:56.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like that...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.04,0:05:56.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.96,0:05:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming! Bye...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.08,0:05:59.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.02,0:06:06.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, it's bad manners to eat and drive.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.28,0:06:13.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't your father on the incoming ship?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.85,0:06:17.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think so. He said he was going Earthside about a week ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.64,0:06:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think they'll be fighting here?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.73,0:06:22.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know. He wouldn't tell me anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.76,0:06:35.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get the Gundam components loaded onto the White Base.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.91,0:06:37.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speed up the ground operations.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.25,0:06:38.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.21,0:06:42.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn the White Base! They're leading a Zeon ship here!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.81,0:06:47.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.60,0:06:48.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.47,0:06:51.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation has a fine new battleship.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.64,0:06:54.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With this new ship, and the completed Gundam...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.35,0:06:57.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we'll have no trouble crushing Zeon!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.30,0:07:19.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Lieutenant Ray. We're docking at Side 7 now.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.72,0:07:21.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please report to the bridge at once.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.81,0:07:24.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.18,0:07:25.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your name is Bright, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.80,0:07:26.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.43,0:07:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many months in the military?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.13,0:07:30.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Six months, sir.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.22,0:07:31.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you're 19 years old, correct?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.89,0:07:32.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.40,0:07:35.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we start mass-producing the Gundam...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.85,0:07:39.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we may be able to end this war without sending kids like you into battle.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.69,0:07:42.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that your son, sir?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.35,0:07:43.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.65,0:07:47.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear there are kids his age fighting as guerrilla soldiers.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.98,0:07:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it true?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.78,0:07:51.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm told that it happens.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.28,0:07:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How terrible.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.37,0:07:55.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming, Lieutenant Ray.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.54,0:08:00.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we weren't able to outrun that Zeon ship.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.39,0:08:01.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, no.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.06,0:08:22.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems I don't have much luck.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.14,0:08:26.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To run into a prize like that on my way home from a mission.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.75,0:08:29.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe they were the lucky ones.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.65,0:08:31.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Lt. Commander Char. But...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.36,0:08:36.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could the Federation's Operation V really be based in a remote Side like this one?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.47,0:08:37.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They do.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.74,0:08:42.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They could be developing a more advanced mobile suit than our Zakus.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.54,0:08:45.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way. Not in such a remote place.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.45,0:08:46.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're late.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.92,0:08:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's coming in.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.35,0:08:51.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Code CC2.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.94,0:08:54.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See? Exactly as I predicted.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.44,0:08:58.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean the Federation has mobile suits?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.77,0:09:01.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should assume their development was successful.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.16,0:09:06.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The third one's a mobile suit as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.10,0:09:07.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There could be more in there.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.45,0:09:10.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This could be our only chance.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.57,0:09:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're just here on recon.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.88,0:09:15.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if they get those mobile suits loaded onto that battleship...!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.84,0:09:19.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be hasty to seek your glory.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.18,0:09:21.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gene, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.91,0:09:22.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at Lt. Commander Char...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.43,0:09:27.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...he built his career on actual combat!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.31,0:09:34.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gene wait?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.89,0:09:38.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you realize this is insubordination?! Cease and desist, Gene!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.82,0:09:41.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's going to care, after I pull this off.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.88,0:10:01.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The sooner you defeat the enemy, the better.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.69,0:10:12.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's close.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.31,0:10:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's an asteroid.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.52,0:10:18.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The way these tremors are traveling, they must be caused by...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.84,0:10:20.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Explosions!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.41,0:10:26.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Zeon. A Zeon attack.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.42,0:10:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.56,0:10:28.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go find my father.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.77,0:10:29.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.65,0:10:31.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Going out could put us all in danger.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.98,0:10:35.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My father's with the military. A shelter like this won't survive...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.11,0:10:38.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to request an evacuation to the ship that just docked today.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.90,0:10:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.97,0:10:43.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.01,0:10:45.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please close the other door.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.39,0:10:53.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Zeon mobile suit...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.30,0:10:56.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this is a Zeon Zaku?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.35,0:11:08.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Civilians must remain in the shelter!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.37,0:11:13.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for an engineering officer named Tem Ray. Where is he?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.16,0:11:14.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probably on the ship...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.78,0:11:16.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unload it.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.96,0:11:18.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.66,0:11:54.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're dead...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.34,0:12:03.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Classified Materials"?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.13,0:12:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-This must be... the Federation's mobile suit.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.73,0:12:30.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was following orders, but...{\i}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.89,0:12:31.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Chief Denim?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.86,0:12:32.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.56,0:12:34.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's moved forward, to support Gene.{\i}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.41,0:12:38.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the Federation has mobile suits there?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.15,0:12:39.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, sir.{\i}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.02,0:12:43.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Slender, take as many pictures as you can... and retreat if it becomes dangerous.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.15,0:12:44.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, sir!{\i}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.74,0:12:46.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What'll we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.79,0:12:50.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that Denim couldn't control a rookie.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.72,0:12:52.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I may have to go out there myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.75,0:12:54.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take us closer to Side 7.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.59,0:12:54.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.92,0:12:57.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get to the space port! Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.96,0:13:00.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Faster! \N- Run!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.36,0:13:04.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Computer-controlled operation...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.28,0:13:08.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A learning type computer...?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.03,0:13:11.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow! No wonder Dad's been preoccupied...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.35,0:13:13.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.00,0:13:18.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.05,0:13:30.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.26,0:13:32.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.43,0:13:34.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.64,0:13:36.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use one of the inner lifts for this.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.27,0:13:38.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,, Fraw Bow, get to the space port!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.88,0:13:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.67,0:13:41.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.83,0:13:43.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.89,0:13:45.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,, What about Lift #3?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.55,0:13:46.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's being used!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.88,0:13:47.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.26,0:13:50.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gundam must go before the evacuees.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.47,0:13:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,, Take it up to the White Base and prepare it for battle.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.02,0:13:53.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.52,0:13:54.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.79,0:13:58.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, why aren't you evacuating?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.11,0:14:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad, are mobile suits more important to you than human beings?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.07,0:14:04.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move it out.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.07,0:14:05.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.28,0:14:07.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get up to the White Base, quickly.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.40,0:14:08.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.70,0:14:10.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the warship that's in port.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.70,0:14:11.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's taking so long?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.72,0:14:14.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The engine won't start!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.54,0:14:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to the White Base. I'll go find a tractor.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.92,0:14:19.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Dad!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.40,0:14:30.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, this is the Federation's secret weapon.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.95,0:14:38.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.44,0:14:40.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Amuro?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.62,0:14:44.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.55,0:14:50.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw... Fraw Bow!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.63,0:14:56.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow, don't give up!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.41,0:15:00.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you stand up?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.27,0:15:10.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Mother?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.40,0:15:12.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandpa?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.95,0:15:23.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mother? Mother?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.83,0:15:25.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.89,0:15:40.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw, they'll get you too. You've gotta go.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.97,0:15:42.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.64,0:15:46.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get a hold of yourself! You're stronger than this!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.15,0:15:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make a run for the space port.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.32,0:15:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can do it, right, Fraw Bow?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.61,0:15:56.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be there soon. Now, go!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.86,0:15:58.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Run, Fraw Bow!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.33,0:16:03.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Run, Fraw...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.67,0:16:12.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it, Fraw Bow...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.51,0:16:15.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Way to go...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.82,0:16:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This will work...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.37,0:16:49.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly the same. Is this it...?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.30,0:16:55.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.09,0:16:57.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The energy gain is more than five times!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.76,0:16:58.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.56,0:17:06.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.60,0:17:08.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.94,0:17:12.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I make it in time?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.51,0:17:14.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Left... and right.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.12,0:17:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Get the weapons!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.36,0:17:26.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,White Base! Can't you launch a Core Fighter?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.52,0:17:27.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Impossible!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.77,0:17:30.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not unless we blast open the Side's hull!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.28,0:17:32.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have we deployed all combat personnel?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.53,0:17:35.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! And we've also sent pilots to retrieve the Gundam.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.01,0:17:39.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We never expected an attack from within the colony.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.47,0:17:45.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rise!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.18,0:17:48.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-He's right in front of me!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.23,0:17:52.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh... weapons...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.82,0:18:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chief Denim!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.64,0:18:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy's mobile suit has moved!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.40,0:18:04.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.86,0:18:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought they were all just unassembled parts!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.20,0:18:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's not functioning very well. I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.84,0:18:26.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This mobile suit is unbelievable!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.33,0:18:27.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The rifles are useless.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.84,0:18:29.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just watch, you damn Zaku!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.73,0:18:40.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're just on a recon mission! Retreat, Gene!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.10,0:18:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?! If we don't get him now, the enemy will...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.74,0:18:45.81,Dialogue,,0,1000,0,,It's standing!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.12,0:18:55.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, get up!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.92,0:18:56.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.89,0:19:06.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.68,0:19:19.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir, one of our mobile suits is operating!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.01,0:19:19.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.72,0:19:23.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of attack is that?! Who's in the cockpit?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.40,0:19:26.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no... I'm out of ammo!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.52,0:19:30.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get you! No matter how thick your armor is...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.40,0:19:34.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's coming!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.92,0:19:44.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like the mobile suit's shaking in terror!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.16,0:20:12.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's the power of the Federation's mobile suit!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.16,0:20:18.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Amazing...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.05,0:20:28.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.95,0:20:31.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doesn't this thing have any other weapons?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.89,0:20:33.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.93,0:20:39.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gene, can you jump to where Slender is?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.26,0:20:42.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll use the back-up camera. I can see.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.10,0:20:43.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to jump!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.06,0:20:46.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.82,0:21:31.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I hit the mobile suit's engine, it might destroy all of Side 7.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.64,0:21:34.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What... What should I do?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.23,0:21:38.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for what you did to Gene!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.19,0:21:42.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What to do... Can I target just the cockpit?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.87,0:21:50.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If this Zaku blows up, all the air in Side 7 will be sucked out!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:16.16,0:22:18.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rush the civilians onto the White Base.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:18.31,0:22:19.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:19.87,0:22:22.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think any more air is escaping.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:22.07,0:22:23.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the transfer of the Gundam?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:23.69,0:22:27.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All the regular engineers were killed.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:27.67,0:22:29.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have him do it
Dialogue: 10,0:22:29.41,0:22:29.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:29.95,0:22:32.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether he's a real pilot or not...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:32.58,0:22:34.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we need his help.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:38.60,0:22:39.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.24,0:22:54.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Slender?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.35,0:22:57.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's escaped Side 7 and is headed this way.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.98,0:23:00.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one likes to admit to them.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.35,0:23:04.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To the mistakes they've made because of their youth.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:18.31,0:23:22.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As Char waits for the White Base to escape from Side 7...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:22.46,0:23:26.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...he shows his true power as the Red Comet, and faces Gundam with brutal force.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.73,0:23:29.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For both Char and Amuro...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.47,0:23:33.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...this battle reveals a ferocity that neither has experienced before.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:33.35,0:23:36.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:36.26,0:23:38.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Destroy Gundam.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:38.36,0:23:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you be able to survive?
